Nmap-Service Version Detection -->  nmap -sV <target-ip>  --> Used to identify open ports, running services, and their versions.
FTP --> ftp <target-ip> --> Used to connect to an FTP service in the authorized lab environment.
Telnet --> telnet <target-ip> <port> --> Used to test connectivity to the Telnet service in the authorized lab environment.
Netstat-Network Connections --> netstat -an --> Used to view active network connections and listening ports.
NBTScan-NetBIOS Enumeration --> nbtscan <target-ip> --> Used to gather NetBIOS-related information from the target system.
SMBClient-SMB Enumeration --> smbclient -L //<target-ip> --> Used to enumerate available SMB shares.
SNMPWalk-SNMP Enumeration --> snmpwalk -v 2c -c public <target-ip> --> Used to enumaerate information exposed through the SNMP service.
